Based on the above observations, we conclude that the parameters used in the refined clustering must be tuned properly for Au+Au dataset at \(\sqrt{s_{\rm NN}}=62.4\) GeV to reduce the large number of split clusters. Hence we should optimize the parameters of the refined clustering by carrying out simulations studies for PMD

