These values mean :

If the \(E_{dep}\) in the first ring of neighbors of the peak cell is less than 30% of its \(E_{dep}\), then those cells belong to the cluster and the rest will form the part of another cluster. If the next ring of cells have \(E_{dep}\) less than 15% of peak cell \(E_{dep}\), then they belong to the cluster and for the third ring the % value is 5.

